            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Kipowi 0.5.4</h2>
<ul>
<li>Move pictures between frames in a layout: press and hold a picture, then drag it to another frame. Dropped on another picture, the two swap.</li>
<li>Rotate and Flip are now two buttons. Rotate turns 90° left on each click (hold ⌥ for right); Flip mirrors left to right (hold ⇧ for top to bottom).</li>
<li>In a layout, Rotate and Flip act on the selected picture.</li>
<li>A rotated picture now keeps its rotation when you start a layout from it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
